WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to newly developed
technology,

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.569 size:84% position:42%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:06.873
to record the tiny voice that
is inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might be surprised
to know

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:09.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
that like everyone's
inner voice,

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:13.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
Donald Trump is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:14.748 line:92%
and is easily distracted.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:19.452
So here is the tiny voice in
the back of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.887 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.092
-Okay, Donald.
It's the tiny voice in the back

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:29.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
of your head reminding you
not to lose the Queen,

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.430 size:81% position:41% line:92%
no matter what you do.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't let her out of your --
Oh, no.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
Where is the Queen?
Oh, where is the Queen?

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:36.903 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Oh, okay, there she is.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.873 line:92%
Now just lumber alongside her.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't talk to her
or look at her.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
Perfect.
Very presidential.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:48.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look at these guys.
Look like nutcrackers.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:49.949 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.651 size:81% position:41% line:92%
What's on their heads?

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:54.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are those big furry hats,
or are they afros?

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hats or afros.
Hats or afros.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's hard to tell.
They're probably hats.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.462 line:92%
But they look a lot like afros.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whenever you ask,
they don't answer.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:07.333
So I guess you're going to
leave England not knowing.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of life's many mysteries,
Donald.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.972 line:92%
One of life's many mysteries.

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, there's a little guy
at the end.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.977 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

